<title>USA: Canton PSD, Miss., $1.035 mln won by Commerce Inv.</title>
<headline>Canton PSD, Miss., $1.035 mln won by Commerce Inv.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerce Inv.said it won $1.035 million of Canton Public School District Miss., limited tax notes, Series 1996,  with a net interest cost of 4.49 percent.</p>
</text>
